Feature: End of game screen

  Background:
    Given The server is prepared for a successful game session
    And I am logged in and on the play menu

  Scenario Outline: Player returns to menu after game ends
    Give I have an active game against "<difficulty>" "<strategy>"
    When I click on the surrender button
    And I click on the return to menu button
    Then I should be redirected to the main menu

    Examples:
      | strategy              | difficulty  |
      | Aleatorio             | NO          |
      | Defensivo             | MEDIUM      |
      | Ofensivo              | HARD        |
      | Posicional            | EASY        |

  Scenario Outline: Player starts a new game after game ends
    Give I have an active game against "<difficulty>" "<strategy>"
    When I click on the surrender button
    And I click on the play again button
    Then I should see the game board

    Examples:
      | strategy              | difficulty  |
      | Aleatorio             | NO          |
      | Defensivo             | MEDIUM      |
      | Ofensivo              | HARD        |
      | Posicional            | EASY        |